    "Buscando…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Looking…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cada carpeta de ~/Developer se nombra por su nombre: «en dilo landing», «en switchboard». Hoy son %lld.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each folder in ~/Developer goes by its name: “in dilo landing”, “in switchboard”. There are %lld today."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cada permiso que pide Claude Code se aprueba con un clic en la muesca; la voz nunca aprueba. Dilo no lee los archivos de Claude Code: qué sesiones hay se lo pregunta a la CLI.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every permission Claude Code asks for is approved with a click in the notch; your voice never approves. Dilo doesn’t read Claude Code’s files: it asks the CLI which sessions there are."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cerrar: la reunión sigue grabando": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Close: the meeting keeps recording"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code por voz": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code by voice"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clic para escuchar desde aquí": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click to listen from here"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clic para ponerle nombre; arrástralo sobre otro para juntarlos": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click to name them; drag onto another to merge them"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copiar la línea": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copy the line"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dile «Claude Code, en Dilo, revisa los tests» y abre una sesión en esa carpeta. Usa tu cuenta de Claude Code, no tu clave de Anthropic.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Say “Claude Code, in Dilo, check the tests” and it opens a session in that folder. It uses your Claude Code account, not your Anthropic key."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dilo se cerró grabando. El audio quedó en disco: afínala para armar el guion.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dilo quit while recording. The audio is on disk: refine it to build the script."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dilo, la reunión": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dilo, the meeting"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dónde está Claude Code": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Where Claude Code is"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El de tu Claude Code": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your Claude Code’s"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El de tu Claude Code es el que tengas configurado en él. Lo que hace Claude Code se cobra a tu plan, no a tu clave.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yours is whatever you set up in Claude Code. What Claude Code does is billed to your plan, not your key."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Elige la carpeta del proyecto. Su nombre es el que vas a decir; lo puedes cambiar.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose the project folder. Its name is what you’ll say; you can change it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Encontrada en %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Found at %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Esperando el disco": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Waiting for the disk"
          }
        }
