    },
    "Grabando. El guion sale al terminar": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recording. The script comes out when you end"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La primera vez, el separador de voces se prepara para el Neural Engine: puede tardar varios minutos. Después tarda menos de un segundo.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The first time, the voice separator gets ready for the Neural Engine: it can take several minutes. After that it takes under a second."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La reunión quedó en el Mac porque el disco de las reuniones no estaba. Se muda y se afina sola cuando vuelva.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The meeting stayed on the Mac because the meetings disk wasn't there. It moves and refines itself when the disk is back."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La reunión se interrumpió": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
