    "Busca por lo dicho o por quién lo dijo: «Camila despacho»": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Search by what was said or who said it: “Camila shipping”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Carpeta de las reuniones": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meetings folder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Carpeta, separador de voces y cuánto dura el audio": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Folder, voice separator and how long the audio stays"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Corre al terminar, sobre el audio de la llamada, en tu Mac. Nemotron 3 separa hasta 8 voces con solapes; Sortformer, hasta 4. Si Nemotron 3 falla, separa Sortformer.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Runs when the meeting ends, on the call audio, on your Mac. Nemotron 3 separates up to 8 voices with overlaps; Sortformer, up to 4. If Nemotron 3 fails, Sortformer separates."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cuánto se guarda el audio": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How long the audio is kept"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dónde se guardan": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Where they're saved"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dónde se guardan, quién separa las voces y el audio": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Where they're saved, who separates the voices, and the audio"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El audio": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The audio"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El guion de quién dijo qué, buscable": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The script of who said what, searchable"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El guion se queda para siempre; esto es sólo el audio. Al quedar listo pasa a AAC, unos 30 MB por hora, y lo que se borra va a la Papelera.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The script stays forever; this is only the audio. Once ready it becomes AAC, about 30 MB per hour, and whatever is deleted goes to the Trash."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El micrófono de la pista «Yo». El del sistema es el que con más probabilidad usa la llamada. No cambia la entrada del sistema ni el micrófono de dictar.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The microphone for the “Me” track. The system one is the one the call most likely uses. It doesn't change the system input or the dictation microphone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Elige dónde se guardan las reuniones.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose where meetings are saved."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "En tus reuniones": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In your meetings"
          }
        }
      }
