    "Mantenla para dictar en %@, o tócala para empezar y tócala de nuevo para terminar": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hold it to dictate in %@, or tap to start and tap again to finish"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mantén %1$@ para hablar y que salga en %2$@, o tócala para empezar y tócala de nuevo para terminar.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hold %1$@ to speak and have it land in %2$@, or tap it to start and tap again to finish."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mantén %@ para dictar en tu otro idioma, o tócala igual que la principal.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hold %@ to dictate in your other language, or tap it like the main one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mantén %@ para hablar y pegar la traducción. Elige antes el idioma en Idioma.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hold %@ to speak and paste a translation. Pick the language in Language first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mantén %@ y habla; suéltala y listo. Un toque corto la deja trabada y otro toque termina.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hold %@ and speak; let go and it lands. A quick tap latches it, another tap finishes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mantén Dilo al día": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep Dilo current"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mantén la tecla para hablar y suéltala para pegar. Si la sueltas antes de esto, el dictado queda abierto hasta que la vuelvas a tocar.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hold the key to talk and release it to paste. Release it sooner than this and dictation stays open until you tap it again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
