    "Avisar cerca del límite": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Warn near the limit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cuando Codex o el plan de Claude pasan el 80 % y el 95 % de una ventana, la muesca se abre un momento a decírtelo. Una vez por umbral, y nunca mientras dictas.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When Codex or your Claude plan passes 80% and 95% of a window, the notch opens for a moment to tell you. Once per threshold, and never while you're dictating."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sube": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
