    "Al pasar el mouse": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On hover"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lo último que copias": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What you last copied"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Junto a tus dictados, lo último que copiaste, para volver a copiarlo con un clic. Lo que un gestor de contraseñas marca como secreto no entra, y nada se guarda al cerrar Dilo.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Next to your dictations, what you last copied, so you can copy it again with one click. Anything a password manager marks as secret stays out, and nothing is kept when you quit Dilo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Próxima reunión": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Next meeting"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La próxima reunión de tu calendario, y «Unirse» si trae un enlace de Zoom, Meet o Teams. Dilo te va a pedir permiso para leer el calendario.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The next meeting on your calendar, with “Join” when it has a Zoom, Meet or Teams link. Dilo will ask for permission to read your calendar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sin permiso para leer el calendario.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No permission to read your calendar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cambiar de modo": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch mode"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tus modos, para elegir con un clic cuál usa el atajo de siempre. «Normal» es el dictado limpio, sin IA.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your modes, to choose with one click which one your usual shortcut uses. “Normal” is plain dictation, no AI."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nota": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Note"
          }
        }
      }
    },
