        }
      }
    },
    "Un botón para dictar y que se pegue traducido al idioma que elegiste en Dictado. Si todavía no elegiste uno, el botón te lleva a elegirlo.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A button to dictate and have it pasted translated into the language you chose in Dictation. If you haven't chosen one yet, the button takes you there."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⌘V → acuse de la app": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⌘V → app acknowledgment"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ (no conectado)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ (not connected)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automático usa el del sistema, salvo que sea Bluetooth: ahí usa uno con cable —el del Mac primero— para que tus audífonos no bajen al sonido de llamada mientras dictas. La entrada del sistema no se toca.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatic uses the system's, unless it's Bluetooth: then it uses a wired one — the Mac's own first — so your headphones don't drop to call-quality sound while you dictate. The system input is left alone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Con cuál te escucho": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Which one I listen with"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deja el micrófono preparado, sin escuchar, hasta media hora después de dictar, para que el próximo dictado abra un poco antes. Sólo con un micrófono con cable o el del Mac. Ocupa algo de memoria mientras espera; viene apagado mientras lo medimos.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keeps the microphone prepared, not listening, for up to half an hour after you dictate, so the next dictation opens a little sooner. Only with a wired microphone or the Mac's own. It uses some memory while it waits; it's off while we measure it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dejarlo listo entre dictados": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep it ready between dictations"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El del sistema": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The system's"
          }
        }
      }
    },
