          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agents"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mostrar agentes en la muesca": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show agents in the notch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code, Codex y otros avisan por su hook cuando trabajan, terminan o te esperan, y la muesca lo muestra al costado. Dilo no lee sus archivos ni sus credenciales: sólo sabe lo que el agente le avisa.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code, Codex and others report through their hook when they work, finish or wait for you, and the notch shows it on the side. Dilo doesn't read their files or credentials: it only knows what the agent tells it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "En ~/.claude/settings.json (o el de un proyecto), dentro del objeto de más afuera:": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In ~/.claude/settings.json (or a project's), inside the outermost object:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "En ~/.codex/config.toml. Codex avisa sólo al terminar cada turno:": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In ~/.codex/config.toml. Codex only reports at the end of each turn:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pone «Claude te espera» al costado de la muesca, como lo haría el hook. Un clic en el segmento lo quita.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shows “Claude is waiting for you” beside the notch, as the hook would. A click on the segment removes it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Falta la clave de Anthropic": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anthropic key missing"
