      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Too long"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@: tradujo Apple": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@: Apple translated"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Traducir con": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Translate with"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pégala en Modos → Proveedor general → Anthropic → API key. Es la misma para los modos y para traducir.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paste it in Modes → Default provider → Anthropic → API key. The same key serves modes and translation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Abrir Modos": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Modes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Los dos idiomas quedan cargados, así que cualquiera de las dos teclas responde igual de rápido. El dictado corre en esta compu; la traducción con Claude, en Anthropic.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both languages stay loaded, so either key responds just as fast. Dictation runs on this Mac; translating with Claude runs at Anthropic."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inglés (EE. UU.)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "English (US)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chino simplificado (mandarín)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Simplified Chinese (Mandarin)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "— lo traduce Apple": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "— translated by Apple"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude (Haiku 5.5)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude (Haiku 5.5)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple, en el Mac": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple, on this Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Corre en esta compu: lo que dictas no sale de ella. Más literal.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Runs on this Mac: what you dictate never leaves it. More literal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude traduce desde el español. Desde tu idioma de dictado traduce Apple.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude translates from Spanish. From your dictation language, Apple translates."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suena escrito por alguien nativo. Lo que dictas viaja a Anthropic; sin conexión traduce Apple, si tiene el modelo.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reads as if a native speaker wrote it. What you dictate goes to Anthropic; offline, Apple translates if it has the model."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Haiku es el más rápido y barato, y alcanza para los modos y para traducir.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Haiku is the fastest and cheapest, and it's plenty for modes and translation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Haiku 5.5 — rápido y barato (recomendado)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Haiku 5.5 — fast and cheap (recommended)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Otro…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Other…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aprender con Claude": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Learn with Claude"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Que Claude revise y ordene": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Let Claude review and tidy"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude revisa lo que corriges antes de ofrecértelo y descarta lo que no es vocabulario. De vez en cuando ordena Tus palabras: junta variantes, fija cómo se escribe cada nombre y saca lo que entró por error. Sin clave, o sin conexión, Dilo aprende como antes, solo.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude reviews what you correct before offering it and drops what isn't vocabulary. Now and then it tidies Your words: it merges variants, settles how each name is spelled and removes what got in by mistake. Without a key, or offline, Dilo learns as before, on its own."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pégala en Modos → Proveedor general → Anthropic → API key. Es la misma de los modos y de traducir.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paste it in Modes → Default provider → Anthropic → API key. It's the same one modes and translation use."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Revisar cada corrección": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Review each correction"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Una pregunta corta después de cada corrección: ¿esto se aprende, y cómo? Haiku 5.5 alcanza y cuesta casi nada.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A short question after each correction: should this be learned, and how? Haiku 5.5 is enough and costs almost nothing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ordenar Tus palabras": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tidy Your words"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Una vez por semana o después de diez palabras nuevas, nunca mientras dictas. Un error ahí se queda pegado, por eso Sonnet 5.5; Opus 5.5 si Sonnet se equivoca seguido.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once a week or after ten new words, never while you dictate. A mistake there sticks, hence Sonnet 5.5; Opus 5.5 if Sonnet keeps getting it wrong."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ordenar ahora": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tidy now"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ordenando…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tidying…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lo que ordenó Claude": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What Claude tidied"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deshacer": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Undo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aplicar": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apply"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qué se manda a Anthropic: al revisar, la palabra corregida con unas ocho palabras antes y después, nunca el campo entero ni el nombre de la app; al ordenar, Tus palabras y «Cuando digo…», nada de lo que dictaste. Nada de eso queda en el registro del sistema. Cada pedido se cobra a tu clave: revisar cuesta una fracción de centavo y ordenar, unos pocos centavos.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What goes to Anthropic: when reviewing, the corrected word with about eight words before and after, never the whole field or the app's name; when tidying, Your words and “When I say…”, nothing you dictated. None of it lands in the system log. Each request is billed to your key: a review costs a fraction of a cent, a tidy a few cents."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ (recomendado)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ (recommended)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude está ordenando. Puedes seguir dictando.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude is tidying. You can keep dictating."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Listo: nada que cambiar.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Done: nothing to change."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Listo: %lld aplicados, %lld propuestos. Están abajo, con su deshacer.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Done: %1$lld applied, %2$lld proposed. They're below, each with its undo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No se pudo: %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn't: %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Todavía no se ordena. Lo hace solo; esto es para no esperar.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not tidied yet. It happens on its own; this is so you don't have to wait."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La última vez fue el %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Last time was %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sacar %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remove %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aplicado": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Applied"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Propuesto: lo escribiste tú o cambia letras, así que no lo apliqué solo": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Proposed: you wrote it or it changes letters, so I didn't apply it on my own"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deshecho": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Undone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude no quiso ordenar esto": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude declined to tidy this"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El diccionario es muy largo para una pasada": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The dictionary is too long for one pass"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude no devolvió algo que se pueda usar": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude didn't return anything usable"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ Claude Haiku 5.5 traduce del español a inglés o chino como alguien nativo. Sin conexión traduce Apple.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ Claude Haiku 5.5 translates from Spanish into English or Chinese like a native speaker. Offline, Apple translates."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ Reescribe lo que dictas con un modo. Haiku es el más rápido, y alcanza.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ Rewrites what you dictate with a mode. Haiku is the fastest, and it's enough."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ Una pregunta corta después de cada corrección: ¿esto se aprende? Haiku alcanza.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ A short question after each correction: should this be learned? Haiku is enough."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ Una vez por semana o tras diez palabras nuevas. Un error ahí se queda pegado: por eso Sonnet.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ Once a week or after ten new words. A mistake there sticks around: hence Sonnet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld ajustes para «%@». Intro abre el primero.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld settings for “%@”. Return opens the first one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A Dilo le falta algo para dictar": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dilo is missing something to dictate"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Abrir Claude": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Claude"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Abrir Motor de voz": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Speech Engine"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apagado: Dilo aprende solo, sin Claude.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off: Dilo learns on its own, without Claude."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apagado: no se guarda nada": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off: nothing is saved"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple traduce en el Mac: lo que dictas no sale de él, pero más literal.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple translates on the Mac: what you dictate never leaves it, but it's more literal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Borrar la búsqueda": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Clear search"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Buscando las voces de esta compu…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Looking for this Mac's voices…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Buscar ajustes": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Search settings"
          }
        }
      }
