    "Algo falló con Claude. ¿Me lo dices de nuevo?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Something went wrong with Claude. Can you say that again?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Anthropic me pidió esperar un poco. Prueba de nuevo en un rato.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anthropic asked me to wait a bit. Try again in a moment."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Anthropic no aceptó la clave. Revísala en Ajustes, en Claude.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
