    "Preparar ahora": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prepare now"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Todavía no está en este Mac. Se baja solo al grabar tu primera reunión (unos 190 MB), o ahora.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's not on this Mac yet. It downloads by itself when you record your first meeting (about 190 MB), or now."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bajando el separador de voces…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Downloading the voice separator…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bajado. La primera vez se prepara para el Neural Engine y puede tardar varios minutos: Dilo lo hace solo cuando no estás dictando.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Downloaded. The first time it gets ready for the Neural Engine and can take several minutes: Dilo does it by itself when you're not dictating."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Preparándolo para el Neural Engine. La primera vez tarda varios minutos; después, menos de un segundo.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Getting it ready for the Neural Engine. The first time takes several minutes; after that, under a second."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Listo: la próxima pasada lo carga en menos de un segundo.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ready: the next pass loads it in under a second."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No se pudo preparar (%@). Vuelve a intentarlo.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn't prepare it (%@). Try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No pude bajar el separador de voces. Revisa la conexión.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I couldn't download the voice separator. Check your connection."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "bajar": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "download"
          }
        }
