    "tope": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "cap"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lo conversado vive en la memoria mientras dura la llamada y se olvida al colgar: no va al historial ni al registro del sistema. Una conversación de diez minutos cuesta unos centavos con Sonnet.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The conversation lives in memory while the call lasts and is forgotten when you hang up: it doesn't go to the history or the system log. A ten-minute conversation costs a few cents with Sonnet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Llama a Dilo para conversar en voz alta: tú hablas, tu voz se transcribe en el Mac y Claude contesta con una voz del Mac. Sólo viaja texto. Córrelo otra vez, o aprieta Colgar en la muesca, para terminar.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Calls Dilo to talk out loud: you speak, your voice is transcribed on the Mac and Claude answers with a Mac voice. Only text travels. Run it again, or press Hang up in the notch, to finish."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "13 de España y 12 de México. No hay voces chilenas.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "13 from Spain and 12 from Mexico. There are no Chilean voices."
          }
        }
      }
    },
