    "Bajar Phonon": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Download Phonon"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El motor son 8 MB y cada voz 250 KB. Se bajan una vez; mientras, lee Apple.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The engine is 8 MB and each voice 250 KB. They download once; meanwhile, Apple reads."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "El reconocimiento, la lectura en voz alta y la transformación de texto corren en esta compu. Dilo no guarda audio. Sólo los modos con proveedor en línea mandan texto afuera, y la tarjeta siempre lo dice.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recognition, reading aloud and text transformation run on this Mac. Dilo doesn't keep audio. Only modes with an online provider send text out, and their card always says so."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "En Ajustes del Sistema, entra a Contenido hablado → Voz del sistema → Gestionar voces y baja una voz Premium. Las voces de Siri no se pueden usar fuera de las apps de Apple. Las voces nuevas aparecen acá solas.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In System Settings, go to Spoken Content → System voice → Manage Voices and download a Premium voice. Siri voices can't be used outside Apple's apps. New voices show up here on their own."
          }
        }
      }
    },
