    },
    "Talkify, de Tornike Gomareli (MIT) · Handy, de CJ Pais (MIT) · FluidAudio, de FluidInference (Apache 2.0) · imnotpayingforwisprflow, de Yosef Shammout (MIT) · Muesli, de Pranav Hari (MIT) · meeting-transcriber, de pasrom (MIT) · Sparkle, de Andy Matuschak y otros (MIT). Se bajan aparte, para leer en voz alta: Phonon 40m, de Gradium (CC BY-NC 4.0, uso personal y no comercial), hecho sobre Pocket TTS y Mimi de Kyutai · sus voces (Apache 2.0) · el motor ptts, de Gradium (MIT o Apache 2.0).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Talkify, by Tornike Gomareli (MIT) · Handy, by CJ Pais (MIT) · FluidAudio, by FluidInference (Apache 2.0) · imnotpayingforwisprflow, by Yosef Shammout (MIT) · Muesli, by Pranav Hari (MIT) · meeting-transcriber, by pasrom (MIT) · Sparkle, by Andy Matuschak and others (MIT). Downloaded separately, for reading aloud: Phonon 40m, by Gradium (CC BY-NC 4.0, personal non-commercial use), built on Kyutai's Pocket TTS and Mimi · its voices (Apache 2.0) · the ptts engine, by Gradium (MIT or Apache 2.0)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tiene términos de uso en Hugging Face y Dilo no lo baja solo. Instálalo una vez con scripts/instalar-phonon.sh (75 MB). Mientras, lee Apple.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It has terms of use on Hugging Face, so Dilo doesn't download it by itself. Install it once with scripts/instalar-phonon.sh (75 MB). Meanwhile, Apple reads."
          }
        }
      }
    },
